  "solution": "Given: A hexagon has 6 sides.\n\nNumber of diagonals = n × (n − 3) ÷ 2\n\n= 6 × (6 − 3) ÷ 2\n\n= 6 × 3 ÷ 2\n\n= 18 ÷ 2\n\n= **9**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **Option 1.**",
